// Collective Defiance — the modal cost-rider acceptance fixture: an escalate
// rider ([CR#702.120a]) on the "one or more" choose-quantity ([CR#700.2]),
// with per-mode targets chosen only for chosen modes ([CR#601.2c]).
//
// BLOCKED leg (event-side, noted for the coordinator): mode 1's oracle text
// continues "…, then draws that many cards" — `Draw(ThatMuch)` needs the
// `Discard` cause-verb entailment row (`entailments.ron`) to grow an
// amount (the number of cards discarded, [CR#701.9]) AND the walker's
// `Discard` action arm to read it as its amount Intro — a
// fact-signature/event-side change this ticket does not own (the
// DealDamage/GainLife/LoseLife action arms key their master forms'
// caps rows since engine-eventfilter-bridge; Discard grants none yet).
// When that lands, mode 1 grows the `Draw(ThatMuch)` leg.
Normal(
  name: "Collective Defiance",
  mana_cost: [Generic(1), Red, Red],
  types: [Sorcery],
  abilities: [
    Spell(effect: Modal(
      choose: ChooseSpec(count: AtLeast(1), rider: Escalate([Mana([Generic(1)])])),
      modes: [
        Mode(effect: Targeted(
          targets: [Target(Exactly(1), Kind(Player))],
          effect: By(Target(0), Discard(
            count: CountOf(AllOf([Kind(Card), InZone(Hand), Owner(Ref(Target(0)))])),
          )),
        )),
        Mode(effect: Targeted(
          targets: [Target(Exactly(1), Type(Creature))],
          effect: DealDamage(Target(0), 4),
        )),
        Mode(effect: Targeted(
          targets: [Target(Exactly(1), OneOf([AllOf([Kind(Player), OpponentOf(Ref(You))]), Type(Planeswalker)]))],
          effect: DealDamage(Target(0), 3),
        )),
      ],
    )),
  ],
)
